/v1/","context":{"app_id":3053870,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3053870-1847286114042606","game_id":"steam-3053870","kind":"update","title":"GRIDHACK Demo Hotfix - Oct 25","summary":"We've just pushed a small update that resolves the following issues:RndRow Module: Fixed issue where this module was usable without cost.Level Cap: Fixed issue with level cap increase not taking effect when purchasing the module.This will be the last hotfix for the demo period. The GRIDHACK demo will most be taken offline on Tuesday, Oct 27th, so make sure to play the game before then. Thank you so much for playing GRIDHACK!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:15:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042606","verified_at":"2026-10-25T18:24:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3053870-1847286114030523","game_id":"steam-3053870","kind":"update","title":"GRIDHACK Demo Hotfix - Oct 21","summary":"We've just pushed a small update that introduces the following:PUZZLE BATTLE: When the \"press SPACE to start\" dialogue appears, clicking the left mouse button will now also start the battle, even when not clicking exactly on the \"SPACE\" button.MAIN MENU: Splash screen can now also skipped with left mouse click.OVERWORLD: You can now also press SPACE to interact with highlighted objects (additionally to the ENTER key).We will keep working on making all inputs more customizable but that might take","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:41:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030523","verified_at":"2026-10-22T03:25:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3053870-1846651706695949","game_id":"steam-3053870","kind":"update","title":"GRIDHACK Demo Hotfix - Oct 20","summary":"Thanks for flagging the various issues and bugs in the demo!We've tried to quickly fix the most common and sever ones, so please make sure to update the demo to benefit from this patch.STORY MODE: Players should now fully heal after failing a hack.STORY MODE: Pause menu and Inventory menu not opening should be resolved.INFILTRATION: Softlock when talking to Tex should be resolved.INFILTRATION: Tutorial/intro triggering even when continuing a saved game should no longer occur. You might have to s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:29:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695949","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:44:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3053870-1846651706691782","game_id":"steam-3053870","kind":"announcement","title":"GRIDHACK DEMO FAQ","summary":"GRIDHACK DEMO FAQThe GRIDHACK DEMO is finally here, so we put together this FAQ to let you know what to expect.What are the contents of the demo?In the GRIDHACK DEMO, you will be able to play:STORY mode: Play the opening moments of the games story chapter, which will automatically end after a certain point is reached. This is the perfect way to start, as it will introduce you to GRIDHACKs setting, tone and a few of the characters. This also features a short tutorial on how to play nonogram games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:27:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news